"#00000066","overlay_style":"solid","gradient_direction":"to top","blurred_reflection":false,"reflection_opacity":75,"padding-block-start":40,"padding-block-end":40}},"image_with_text_boxed_p7ppeN":{"type":"image-with-text-boxed","name":"We love a good yarn!","settings":{"main_heading":"Corporate Gifting","heading_size":"h2","sub_heading":"","main_text":"<p>We are proud to work with a wide range of companies in New Zealand to provide their corporate gifting solution.<\/p><p>Corporate customers tell us they love the storey of our lambswool throw blankets and that they are 100% New Zealand made. A natural, ethical and high-quality product from the land is a great fit with their brands and provides a lasting reminder of great service.<\/p><p>If you would like to talk to us about our luxury lambswool throws as your corporate gift, please get in touch.<\/p><p>As well as our gorgeous gift boxes, we can also help make that special and lasting connection with your customers by providing bespoke label options with your brand.<\/p>","button_text":"","button_link":"","left_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/IMG_3249.jpg","image_height_mode":"match","image_aspect_ratio":"square","image_object_fit":"cover","image_min_height":0,"image_max_height":1200,"column_position":"right","mobile_reverse_columns":false,"column_ratio":"equal","content_alignment":"left","vertical_alignment":"top","column_gap":40,"section_width":"page-width","heading_font":"heading","text_font":"body","heading_size_desktop":40,"subheading_size_desktop":18,"text_size_desktop":16,"heading_size_mobile":32,"subheading_size_mobile":16,"text_size_mobile":14,"column_background_color":"#ffffff","column_padding":50,"column_padding_mobile":20,"column_border_radius":8,"color_scheme":"scheme-1","image_border_radius":8,"enable_animation":true,"animation_delay":"0.2s","padding-block-start":50,"padding-block-end":50,"padding-block-start-mobile":25,"padding-block-end-mobile":25}},"image_with_text_boxed_DHTUDC":{"type":"image-with-text-boxed","name":"We love a good yarn!","settings":{"main_heading":"Paterson & Co Realty - Corporate Gifts","heading_size":"h2","sub_heading":"","main_text":"<p><em>\"Paterson & Co Realty has enjoyed a wonderful relationship with Palliser Ridge over the past two years. We love thanking our valued clients with a high-quality, locally made gift, and the Palliser Ridge wool blankets have been the perfect choice.<\/em><\/p><p><em>The team at Palliser Ridge are always professional, friendly, and a pleasure to deal with. What we value most is their boutique, personalised approach to business, which closely aligns with our own philosophy at Paterson & Co. Their commitment to quality, service, and supporting local makes them an outstanding business to partner with, and we look forward to continuing our relationship for years to come.\"<\/em><\/p><p><em>Kate Paterson - Paterson & Co.<\/em><\/p>","button_text":"","button_link":"","left_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Kate_Palliser_Ridge.jpg","image_height_mode":"auto","image_aspect_ratio":"square","image_object_fit":"cover","image_min_height":0,"image_max_height":1200,"column_position":"left","mobile_reverse_columns":false,"column_ratio":"equal","content_alignment":"left","vertical_alignment":"top","column_gap":40,"section_width":"page-width","heading_font":"heading","text_font":"body","heading_size_desktop":40,"subheading_size_desktop":18,"text_size_desktop":16,"heading_size_mobile":32,"subheading_size_mobile":16,"text_size_mobile":14,"column_background_color":"#ffffff","column_padding":50,"column_padding_mobile":20,"column_border_radius":8,"color_scheme":"scheme-1","image_border_radius":8,"enable_animation":true,"animation_delay":"0.2s","padding-block-start":50,"padding-block-end":50,"padding-block-start-mobile":25,"padding-block-end-mobile":25}},"image_with_text_boxed_hQpJfD":{"type":"image-with-text-boxed","name":"We love a good yarn!","settings":{"main_heading":"Better Eggs Family - Corporate Gifts","heading_size":"h2","sub_heading":"","main_text":"<p><em>\"We partnered with the team at Palliser Ridge to create something pretty special for our winter team gifts - and honestly, it was a great experience from start to finish.They were an absolute dream to work with - open, collaborative, and genuinely keen to bring the idea to life. Together, we created blankets in our brand colours, finished with a custom leather badge we could personalise with our own message and logo.The blankets themselves are something else - beautiful quality. The kind of gift you keep for years. Practical, but also something you’re proud to have in your home. Being able to give our team a little bit of Better Eggs they can take home and enjoy was a big part of it for us. We’ve also had a few extras to share with business partners and sponsorship donations for raffles and auctions - such a great gift to have on hand!Backing another New Zealand farming business was a big part of it too. With their roots in the Wairarapa - and us having a site there as well - it was important for us support local and the one of the communities we operate in. On top of that, everything ran smoothly. The team even offered to deliver the blankets themselves straight to our Masterton site -  above and beyond, and exactly the kind of people you want to work with.We’d happily recommend Palliser Ridge to anyone looking for a personalised, meaningful gift - well made, thoughtful - all while supporting a kiwi business!” - From the Better Eggs Family <\/em><\/p>","button_text":"","button_link":"","left_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Screen_Shot_2026-06-19_at_1.32.11_PM.png","image_height_mode":"match","image_aspect_ratio":"square","image_object_fit":"cover","image_min_height":0,"image_max_height":1200,"column_position":"right","mobile_reverse_columns":false,"column_ratio":"equal","content_alignment":"left","vertical_alignment":"top","column_gap":40,"section_width":"page-width","heading_font":"heading","text_font":"body","heading_siz